BraleModule_RenounceOwnership
├── when the caller is the owner
│   └── it should revert with BraleModule_OwnershipCannotBeRenounced
├── when the caller is not the owner
│   └── it should revert with BraleModule_OwnershipCannotBeRenounced
└── when ownership is transferred in two steps
    └── it should still work after a failed renounce
